POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/message/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": 3,
  "role": "user",
  "content": "这是第三个对话的第一条消息"
}

###

### 查看所有对话
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/list

