### ========================================
### 清理测试数据（谨慎使用）
### ========================================

### 删除测试对话1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/1

###

### 删除测试对话2
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/2

###

### 删除测试对话3
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/3

###

### 删除测试对话4
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/4

###

### 验证删除结果（应该返回空列表）
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/list

###
